sequenceDiagram
    actor Student as Diploma Student
    participant Portal as Thesis Portal
    participant API as Review API
    participant Queue as Analysis Queue
    participant Parser as Document Parser
    participant Model as Similarity Model
    database Repo as Submission Store
    database Index as Citation Index
    participant Supervisor as Supervisor Console
    participant Notify as Notification Service

    Student->>Portal: Upload explanatory note
    Portal->>API: Create submission record
    API->>Repo: Store source archive
    API->>Queue: Enqueue review job
    loop For every uploaded document
        Queue->>Parser: Extract text and metadata
        Parser->>Index: Resolve bibliography references
        alt Source is readable
            Parser-->>Queue: Parsed document model
            Queue->>Model: Score similarity and structure
            Model-->>Queue: Risk score and fragments
        else Source has format error
            Parser-->>Queue: Parser diagnostics
            Queue->>Notify: Ask student to reupload
            Notify-->>Student: Send correction notice
        end
    end
    Queue->>API: Save review result
    API->>Repo: Attach rendered report
    API->>Supervisor: Publish review card
    alt Supervisor approves
        Supervisor->>API: Mark as ready for defense
        API->>Notify: Send approval message
        Notify-->>Student: Defense package accepted
    else Supervisor requests changes
        Supervisor->>API: Create revision task
        API->>Notify: Send revision list
        Notify-->>Student: Update required sections
    end
